OL,3,GNEWSADirector criticises lack of
OL,4,Afilming incentives
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Guernsey-raised filmmaker has
OL,7,Fcriticised the island's lack of
OL,8,Fgovernment incentives for productions
OL,9,Fwanting to film on the island.
OL,11,FWriter and director Gene Fallaize plans
OL,12,Fto shoot forthcoming German occupation
OL,13,Fdrama Under the Watchful Gaze in
OL,14,FGuernsey and at Pinewood Studios in the
OL,15,FUK.
OL,17,FHowever, he said filming on the island
OL,18,Fcame at a "considerable financial
OL,19,Fpremium" because rival jurisdictions
OL,20,Foffer tax incentives and other support
OL,21,Fthat Guernsey does not.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
